title: The KPD's Enemies
new-page: true

# adapted from eldiabla666's amazing Roter Regen mod

@enemies
title: Enemies
view-if: {!
    if (Q.kpd_rally_post_timer > 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.labor_minister_party == "KPD" && Q.labor_affairs_post_timer > 0 && Q.strike_term_seen_post_timer > 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.kpd_enemies_post_timer > 0) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> will decide on who they will consider their main opponents

- @weimar
- @spd
- @nsdap
- @fascists
- @bourgeois
- @reactionaries

@weimar
title: The <span style="color: #000000;">We</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">im</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ar</span> establishment - the SPD, [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?], and [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: and <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?].
view-if: {!
    if (Q.kpd_leader == "Weddingers") {
        if (Q.kpd_relation < 40) {
            if (Q.spd_votes >= 40) {
                return false;
            } else if (Q.weimar_coalition > Q.far_right_coalition) {
                return true;
            } else {
                return false;
            }
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Thälmann") {
        if (Q.kpd_relation < 40) {
            if (Q.spd_votes >= 30) {
                return false;
            } else if (Q.weimar_coalition > Q.center_right_coalition) {
                return true;
            } else {
                return false;
            }
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Conciliators") {
        if (Q.nsdap_votes >= 20) {
            return false;
        } else if (Q.far_right_coalition > Q.right_coalition) {
            return false;
        } else if (Q.weimar_coalition > Q.right_coalition && Q.kpd_relation < 40) {
            return true;
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

Attacking the establishment is popular among <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>'s left and center, who consider the need for a revolutionary offensive.

@spd
title: The <span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-<span style="color: #7A3C00;">Fascist</span> <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>
view-if: {!
    if (Q.kpd_leader == "Weddingers") {
        if (Q.kpd_relation < 40) {
            if (Q.spd_votes >= 40) {
                return true;
            } else {
                return false;
            }
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Thälmann") {
        if (Q.kpd_relation < 40) {
            if (Q.spd_votes >= 30) {
                return true;
            } else {
                return false;
            }
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Conciliators") {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Brandlerites") {
        return false;
    }
!}

Attacking the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> is popular among the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>'s left and center, who consider the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> to be the left wing of <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Fascism</span>

@nsdap
title: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> alone
view-if: {!
    if (Q.kpd_leader == "Weddingers") {
        if (Q.kpd_relation < 40) {
            return false;
        } else {
            if (Q.nsdap_votes >= 30) {
                return true;
            } else {
                return false;
            }
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Thälmann") {
        if (Q.kpd_relation < 40) {
            return false;
        } else {
            if (Q.nsdap_votes >= 20) {
                return true;
            } else {
                return false;
            }
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Conciliators") {
        if (Q.nsdap_votes >= 20) {
            return true;
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Brandlerites") {
        if (Q.nsdap_votes >= 10) {
            return true;
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    }
!}

[? if kpd_nazi_urgency == 0 or nsdap_votes < 10: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> is a tiny party right now, with more bark than bite. Many in the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> are questioning their leadership's choices. [? if nsdap_votes < 8: Worst still, giving them too much attention might only end up helping them. ?] ?][? if kpd_nazi_urgency > 0 and nsdap_votes >= 10 : The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span> are the most urgent problem for the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> to deal with. ?]

