@bourgeois
title: The <span style="color: #000000;">bourgeois</span> parties - the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?], [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>, and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: and <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?]
view-if: {!
    if (Q.kpd_leader == "Weddingers") {
        if (Q.kpd_relation < 40) {
            if (Q.spd_votes >= 40) {
                return false;
            } else if (Q.weimar_coalition > Q.far_right_coalition) {
                return false;
            } else if (Q.spd_votes >= 30) {
                return false;
            } else {
                return true;
            }
        } else {
            if (Q.nsdap_votes >= 30) {
                return false;
            } else if (Q.far_right_coalition > Q.right_coalition) {
                return false;
            } else {
                return true;
            }
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Thälmann") {
        if (Q.kpd_relation < 40) {
            if (Q.spd_votes >= 30) {
                return false;
            } else if (Q.weimar_coalition > Q.center_right_coalition) {
                return false;
            } else if (Q.spd_votes >= 20) {
                return false;
            } else {
                return true;
            }
        } else {
            if (Q.nsdap_votes >= 20) {
                return false;
            } else if (Q.far_right_coalition > Q.center_right_coalition) {
                return false;
            } else {
                return true;
            }
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Conciliators") {
        if (Q.nsdap_votes >= 20) {
                return false;
        } else if (Q.far_right_coalition > Q.right_coalition) {
                return false;
        } else if (Q.weimar_coalition > Q.right_coalition && Q.kpd_relation < 40) {
                return false;
        } else {
            return true;
        }
    } else if (Q.kpd_leader == "Brandlerites") {
        if (Q.nsdap_votes >= 10) {
                return false;
        } else if (Q.far_right_coalition > Q.center_right_coalition) {
                return false;
        } else {
            return true;
        }
    }
!}

The <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>'s anti-bourgeois rhetoric is popular among the whole of their party.

